3
00:01:41,009 --> 00:01:43,250
[Jiangcheng University Basketball Team]

4
00:01:41,229 --> 00:01:41,920
Come on.

5
00:01:42,479 --> 00:01:43,560
Everyone, gather around.

6
00:01:43,560 --> 00:01:44,430
Come on, come on.

7
00:01:44,430 --> 00:01:45,280
Hui.

8
00:01:45,789 --> 00:01:46,430
Hui.

9
00:01:47,039 --> 00:01:47,560
Hui.

10
00:01:47,560 --> 00:01:48,640
-Hui.
-Hui.

11
00:01:48,520 --> 00:01:54,720
[Jiangcheng University Basketball Team]

12
00:01:48,920 --> 00:01:49,509
Hui.

13
00:01:50,590 --> 00:01:52,990
There's something I need to tell everyone.

14
00:01:53,710 --> 00:01:54,950
Tang Hui won't

15
00:01:55,479 --> 00:01:58,150
be able to come with us
to the national championships.

16
00:01:58,150 --> 00:01:58,840
Why?

17
00:01:58,840 --> 00:02:00,700
She's leaving for the U.S. early.

18
00:02:01,000 --> 00:02:02,480
You never said anything about it before.

19
00:02:02,480 --> 00:02:03,430
Yeah, why is it so sudden?

20
00:02:03,430 --> 00:02:04,430
Didn't you promise to

21
00:02:04,430 --> 00:02:05,400
go with us to nationals?

22
00:02:05,320 --> 00:02:07,190
[Jiangcheng University Basketball Team]

23
00:02:05,400 --> 00:02:06,590
-Yeah.
-Hui, are you really leaving?

24
00:02:06,590 --> 00:02:07,310
Hui.

25
00:02:07,310 --> 00:02:08,840
Hui, you're joking, right?

26
00:02:08,910 --> 00:02:09,979
-Why, Hui?
-Please don't go.

27
00:02:09,979 --> 00:02:10,440
Come on, stay.

28
00:02:10,440 --> 00:02:11,400
-Yeah.
-Can't you stay?

29
00:02:11,400 --> 00:02:13,200
Go ahead and tell them yourself.

30
00:02:15,870 --> 00:02:16,870
Here's the thing.

31
00:02:17,470 --> 00:02:18,960
I got a job offer from

32
00:02:18,960 --> 00:02:20,470
a pretty good company in the U.S.

33
00:02:20,470 --> 00:02:23,150
They want me to cut my break short
and come back early.

34
00:02:23,150 --> 00:02:24,950
I thought about it for a long time

35
00:02:25,000 --> 00:02:26,120
and decided

36
00:02:26,360 --> 00:02:28,090
I can't miss this opportunity.

37
00:02:29,800 --> 00:02:30,750
That's such a shame.

38
00:02:30,750 --> 00:02:32,280
My only regret is...

39
00:02:34,800 --> 00:02:37,600
that I won't be able to
accompany you to nationals.

40
00:02:39,400 --> 00:02:40,710
But I believe

41
00:02:40,800 --> 00:02:42,000
that even without me,

42
00:02:42,280 --> 00:02:43,520
you'll win.

43
00:02:45,120 --> 00:02:45,910
So, Hui,

44
00:02:46,240 --> 00:02:47,630
when will you come back?

45
00:02:48,470 --> 00:02:49,430
We'll see.

46
00:02:49,680 --> 00:02:51,750
You have to tell us when you do.

47
00:02:51,960 --> 00:02:53,190
-Yeah, you have to let us know.
-Yeah.

48
00:02:53,190 --> 00:02:54,630
Take good care of yourself over there.

49
00:02:54,630 --> 00:02:56,560
We'll give it our all at nationals.

50
00:02:57,430 --> 00:02:58,310
Got it.

51
00:02:58,360 --> 00:02:59,079
Alright.

52
00:02:59,230 --> 00:03:00,750
Alright, don't be so sad.

53
00:03:00,750 --> 00:03:01,750
Hui is going back early,

54
00:03:01,750 --> 00:03:03,280
and we should wish her well.

55
00:03:04,310 --> 00:03:04,750
Yeah.
Yes.

56
00:03:04,750 --> 00:03:05,520
Congratulations, Hui.

57
00:03:05,520 --> 00:03:06,910
-Congratulations, Hui.
-Congratulations, Hui.

58
00:03:06,910 --> 00:03:07,910
Congratulations, Hui.

59
00:03:07,910 --> 00:03:09,790
-Keep in touch.
-Congratulations.

60
00:03:09,790 --> 00:03:13,050
[Jiangcheng University Basketball Team]

61
00:03:11,240 --> 00:03:12,080
Alright.

62
00:03:12,400 --> 00:03:14,360
I'd better get going.

63
00:03:15,870 --> 00:03:16,750
You'd better

64
00:03:16,750 --> 00:03:18,630
play well at nationals.

65
00:03:18,710 --> 00:03:19,520
You hear me?

66
00:03:19,910 --> 00:03:20,360
Bye.

67
00:03:20,360 --> 00:03:21,420
-We hear you.
-Bye.

68
00:03:21,470 --> 00:03:22,030
Goodbye!

69
00:03:22,030 --> 00:03:23,190
-Hui, have a safe trip!
-Take care, Hui!

70
00:03:23,190 --> 00:03:24,340
-Goodbye, Hui.
-Goodbye.

71
00:03:24,340 --> 00:03:25,340
Bye, Hui.

72
00:03:25,370 --> 00:03:26,090
Tang Hui.

73
00:03:28,000 --> 00:03:29,060
Let me walk you out.

74
00:03:33,120 --> 00:03:33,750
Let's go.

75
00:03:36,079 --> 00:03:37,190
Come on, let's go practice.

76
00:03:36,230 --> 00:03:39,630
[Jiangcheng University Basketball Team]

77
00:03:37,190 --> 00:03:38,470
-Let's go.
-Let's go.

78
00:04:01,990 --> 00:04:02,590
Alright.

79
00:04:05,120 --> 00:04:06,360
Take care of yourself.

80
00:04:06,360 --> 00:04:07,280
Remember to call

81
00:04:07,280 --> 00:04:09,410
