82
00:04:10,000 --> 00:04:11,560
Being in love really changes a person.

83
00:04:11,560 --> 00:04:13,620
You even sound all warm and sweet now.

84
00:04:18,510 --> 00:04:19,560
So,

85
00:04:19,829 --> 00:04:21,560
you've moved on from

86
00:04:22,310 --> 00:04:23,910
